Documentation- (Screenshots + Brief Sumamry of Week Task 4)
The PDF serves as complete supporting documentation for the successful implementation of the Azure Storage Account and Azure Data Factory end-to-end data pipeline.

Objective-
To understand Azure cloud concepts and build an end-to-end data pipeline using Azure Storage Account and Azure Data Factory (ADF).

Deliverables-
1. Resource Group Setup  
2. Storage Account Configuration  
3. Blob container creation
4. Upload CSV File
5. Azure Data Factory Setup
6. IAM Role Assignments
7. Storage Blob Data Contributor
8. Linked Service Configuration
9. Pipeline creation
10. Dataset Creation
11. Get Metadata and Copy data
12. Setting up connection between the
13. Pipeline Execution

Outcome-
This Week successfully demonstrated Azure cloud fundamentals, secure storage access, metadata validation, and automated data movement using Azure Data Factory.
